            "review_title": "Review at Beer Seven - 7B Đinh Liệt",
            "review_text": "loonylou78\nWest Sussex, United Kingdom408 contributions\n0\nGreat find!\nSep 2023 • Couples\nFound this place while wandering around the old quarter during our first day in Hanoi. Although quiet we were greeted by super friendly staff and shown to a table overlooking the street below. We chose drinks and some nibbles and had a thoroughly lovely evening. Food was great and very reasonable. As mentioned the staff were really friendly and helpful with travel advise for us for our upcoming tour, would highly recommend!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten October 11, 2023",
